WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.834
- ROOMMATE MEETING.

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:03.069
ROOMMATE MEETING!

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.838
- GOGO, WHAT THE HELL?
I'VE GOT A HANGOVER!

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.340
- I DON'T GIVE A [bleep]

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.542
ABOUT YOUR HANGOVER,
OKAY, BRENDAN?

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:13.646
I WANT A ROOMMATE MEETING,
AND I WANT IT NOW!

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.713
OKAY.

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:16.849
NOW, SOMEBODY'S
BEEN TAKING [bleep]

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:18.017
OUT OF THE REFRIGERATOR

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.451
AND THROWING IT
ON THE GROUND,

00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:21.254
AND IT'S PISSING ME OFF.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.489
IS THIS ANOTHER ONE
OF YOUR STUPID PRANKS, JONALD?

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:26.091
- NO.
AND YOUR PRANKS ARE STUPID.

00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:28.595
- IS IT YOU, MONDAY?
- WHAT?

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:29.962
[eerie music]
- I SAID,

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.731
SOMEBODY'S BEEN TAKING [bleep]
OUT OF THE FRIDGE

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.332
AND THROWING IT
ON THE [bleep] GROUND.

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:34.900
AND I WANT TO KNOW
WHO IT IS,

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.936
BECAUSE IT'S NOT FUNNY!

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:38.104
- WELL, WHAT I WANT TO KNOW IS,

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.772
WHO KEEPS PULLING THE SHEETS
OFF MY BED

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.708
AND HANGING THEM
FROM THE CEILING FAN AT NIGHT?

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:44.377
- WAS THAT YOU, MONDAY?
- WHAT?

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.745
- HAVE YOU BEEN TAKING
EVERYBODY'S SHEETS OFF THEM

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:49.882
IN THE NIGHT AND HANGING THEM
FROM THE CEILING FANS?

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.116
- WHAT? NO.

00:00:51.116 --> 00:00:53.886
- WELL, CLEARLY,
SOMEONE'S BEEN DOING THAT!

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.221
[glass shatters]
- WHOA!

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.556
WHO DID THAT?

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.425
- YEAH! WHO THE [bleep]
JUST DID THAT?

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:01.593
- WHICH ONE OF YOU
JUST THREW THAT BOTTLE?

00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:03.729
- WHAT ARE WE EVEN TALKING
ABOUT RIGHT NOW?

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.298
- DID YOU [bleep]ING THROW
THAT BOTTLE, JONALD?

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:07.867
- NO, GOGO!

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.402
[bleep] YOU!
I DIDN'T THROW IT!

00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:12.972
- WELL, DID YOU [bleep]ING THROW
THAT BOTTLE, BRENDON?

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.708
- YEAH!
YOU WOULD DO THAT, BRENDON.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.711
- DUDE, NO!
I DIDN'T THROW THE BOTTLE!

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:21.814
- WELL, SOMEBODY THREW
THAT [bleep]ING BOTTLE,

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:24.249
AND YOU'RE THE ONE WHO DREW
DICKS ON EVERYONE'S FOREHEAD!

00:01:24.249 --> 00:01:26.286
- YEAH, YOU DID DO THAT!

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.153
- BUT DICKS ARE HILARIOUS,
THOUGH!

00:01:28.153 --> 00:01:29.955
THIS IS JUST DESTRUCTIVE!

00:01:29.955 --> 00:01:31.491
WHAT ABOUT YOU, MONDAY?

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.059
DID YOU THROW THAT BOTTLE?

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.794
[low growl]
- WHAT BOTTLE?

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.397
- THE [bleep]ING BOTTLE, DUDE!

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.132
IT JUST SMASHED
AGAINST THE WALL,

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:41.133
AND YOU EVEN SAID
SOME [bleep] ABOUT IT!

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.736
- WELL, I DIDN'T THROW
A BOTTLE.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.739
- WELL, OBVIOUSLY,
IT WASN'T PING.

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:48.875
HE'S GOT THE BEST GRADES
IN THE HOUSE.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:52.412
- [hisses]

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.813
- GOOD POINT, PING.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:56.449
COME ON, GUYS, LET'S COOL IT
WITH THE PROFANITY.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.618
YOU KNOW PING'S VERY RELIGIOUS.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.320
- [growls]

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.322
[guys groaning]

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:05.458
- AW, PING!
- UGH!

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.458
- COME ON!

